                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Between September 10 and 14, Secretary Acheson held meetings in Washington with
                    the British and French Foreign Ministers; for full documentation on these
                    meetings, see <ref target="frus:frus1951v03p1/pg_1163">volume III, Part 1, pages
                        1163</ref> ff. For the minutes of a meeting on September 11 between
                    Secretary Acheson and British Foreign Minister Morrison, at which there was some
                    discussion of policy with regard to China, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1951v07p1/pg_893">page 893</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
